{
  "abstract": null,
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\" data-listener-added_15ecd590=\"true\" data-listener-added_cf5f9ad6=\"true\" data-listener-added_ed44aecb=\"true\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-jiC80GhZ\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">针对营销数据获取，本篇为大家提供了两种切实可行的数据推送方案，帮助大家高效、稳定、近实时地获取数据，更好地运用数据给营销投放提效。</span></p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-baWVRBAW\" id=\"link-0\">SPI</h2><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-Fac4kTVm\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-GwFGwEHs\">通过开发者创建的订阅任务，平台实时监听数据变动，当订阅的数据发生变动时，平台会实时推送变动消息至开发者，开发者基于收到的消息后再调用API接口获取数据，减少轮询次数。</p></blockquote><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-4XicKEVn\" id=\"link-1\">RDS</h2><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-9MFEfDeB\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-f0X58aBO\">通过开发者创建的订阅任务，平台实时监听数据变动，当订阅的数据发生变动时，平台会实时推送数据至连山RDS进行存储，开发者可以在连山平台部署相关应用进行数据读取，无需再次调用API接口，彻底解决频控问题。</p></blockquote><p data-id=\"p838747a-vNKisJDk\"><strong>RDS推送、SPI推送、HTTP API拉取能力对比</strong></p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t615773a-TQC80J08\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-B1lf4lS9\"><col data-id=\"c90f4947-W8bdGdUg\" span=\"1\" width=\"25%\"/><col data-id=\"c90f4947-f072gGZU\" span=\"1\" width=\"25%\"/><col data-id=\"c90f4947-O49R7Th9\" span=\"1\" width=\"25%\"/><col data-id=\"c90f4947-CKEhPol9\" span=\"1\" width=\"25%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-44AELO8U\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-Tg06ZMRk\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-eTGQEJPZ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-4GNq3YZH\"><br/></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-H0HEKFBG\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-UFK0al3k\"><strong>RDS推送</strong></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-a68Nh2R9\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-q90MXWdc\"><strong>SPI推送</strong></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t8897229-KXEMDZYm\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Bc7pgGRd\"><strong>API拉取</strong></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-5DXIJUVR\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-7ekJUiTj\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-K98mTJ7I\"><strong>效率</strong></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-q6BannZf\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-wP5C9qmG\"><span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><strong>高</strong></span>：数据直接推送到RDS，效率取决于RDS本身，比SPI推送和API拉取处理链路更短，效率会更高</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-ESjaNHL3\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-fIAeDaOj\"><span style=\"color: #6425d0;\"><strong>中</strong></span>：数据推送到开发者接口上，推送效率取决于ISV接口性能</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t8897229-VmCVOTBi\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-wNSX7XDt\"><span style=\"color: #2ea121;\"><strong>低</strong></span>：通过接口一个个拉取，因为考虑到性能和平台稳定性，有频控限制，数据拉取效率受限</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-2TLKSVU7\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-re1C8deJ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-vngx2spq\"><strong>时效性</strong></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-Anf20kPo\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-khcY8gG8\"><span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><strong>高</strong></span>：推送性能完全由RDS本身决定，性能对失效性的受限较小；数据通过binlog、主动通知等方式感知数据变化，比轮询方式时效性更高</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-Stubl3C6\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ke254P6x\"><span style=\"color: #6425d0;\"><strong>中</strong></span><strong> - </strong><span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><strong>高</strong></span>：如果开发者接口性能较好，时效可以跟RDS保持一致</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t8897229-7aMR4UOd\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-W6BF6voC\"><span style=\"color: #2ea121;\"><strong>低</strong></span>：因为有频控的限制，所以数据拉取频率受限，数据时效性较低</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-UDDl5d20\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-gnOundP7\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-PgbCJP9v\"><strong>频控限制</strong></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-8WeO8bG1\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-UHinIkqX\"><span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><strong>受RDS写入性能限制</strong></span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-YYDgKpMG\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-UB0dsRXH\"><span style=\"color: #6425d0;\"><strong>受开发者接口性能限制</strong></span></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t8897229-6LnEPI8p\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-wBAp8iaD\"><span style=\"color: #2ea121;\"><strong>受频控等级限制</strong></span></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-Eko1Pha0\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-fg9FcZ8l\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-LXILP518\"><strong>平台稳定性</strong></p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" colspan=\"2\" data-id=\"t00ff7cc-SYDDWJNP\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-K14jcNCk\"><span style=\"color: #d83931;\">推送速率可控，平台稳定性强</span></p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"tc10e1ad-ZmkOCmZf\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-i8uhnABK\">各ISV访问峰谷不完全可控，为保证平台稳定性，对访问频控有严格限制。但是在高峰期，接口超时较严重</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-7iLOLUOO\"><br/></p></div>",
  "doc_type": 1,
  "going_offline": false,
  "is_new": false,
  "path": null,
  "title": "数据推送服务"
}
